{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05382","headline":"奉和圣制送张说上集贤学士赐宴 · 陆坚","name":"奉和圣制送张说上集贤学士赐宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣主崇文教，层霄降德音。\n尊贤泽既厚，式宴宠逾深。\n复有夔龙相，良哉简帝心。\n得人惟迈昔，多士谅推今。\n书殿荣光满，儒门喜气临。\n顾惟诚滥吹，徒此接衣簪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆坚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05382.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05382","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}